      "writtenOn": "2020-02-10T17:43:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we keep EN_BL_OD low from the EC, the display backlight enabled will stay low due to onboard open drain diode logic. \nHence we made this pin high, so that AP_EDP_BKLTEN pin from SOC can control the Back light.",
